Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the World of Revolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a dating sim set at the Royal Academy\Nwith three princes to choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's only one character I'd\Nchoose, and that's Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with you and\NI don't care who knows it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire Francois,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the spoiled bossy rich\Ngirl who torments the hero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until her plans blow up\Nin her face at the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm in\Nlove with the villainous.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.60,0:00:39.89,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.19,0:00:42.86,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:45.82,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.11,0:00:49.00,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.00,0:00:51.96,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.96,0:00:54.99,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.99,0:00:58.01,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:01:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want only you! Who said? that you want?
