Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mind is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? I know!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.19,0:01:24.61,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
