Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.33,0:01:39.12,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.12,0:01:44.08,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
