Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You conceived attempt at humor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lift up your head and face me at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.66,0:02:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I opened my eyes and there she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.42,0:02:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to share a desk with a commoner.
