Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to learn your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Addressing me by name alone as\Nthough you've earned that right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:02:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just like the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must always remember the\Nproper way to address your betters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you remember my name, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to insult me?
