Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.05,0:03:18.97,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnBellova\fs108\fad(100,100)\pos(960,843)\fsp6\c&H000000&\blur0.8}Rae Taylor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray Taylor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taylor's the family name of the game's\Nprotagonist and Ray's the username I chose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seriously might pass out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this means what I think it does, then\Nhave I been reincarnated in another world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I'm in love with you\Nand I don't care who knows it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unhand me, you miscreant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you gone completely mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am crazy in love with you, if\Nthat's what you're asking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, do you think you\Ncan curry favor with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.98,0:03:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No flowery words of love will soften\Nmy disdain for a mere commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.86,0:03:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you're so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, was that all loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I got carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By how ridiculously adorable\Nyou are, that is! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone you hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Miss Claire? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I had made that obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am 100 % okay with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you should keep\Nthe bullying coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please! I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Y-Whaaa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a totally awesome start to a\Nsuper fun-filled school year, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you enjoy\Nevery moment with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot imagine why you would assume I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to associate with\Nyou at all after today!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How silly of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way you were just staring off into\Nspace, I thought you were part of the decor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not expecting an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got your minions,\Nbut you're so independent,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:04:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you pick on your targets yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.04,0:05:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to totally subvert the bully\Nstereotype, you are so brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you even talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mentioned I love you, because I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was an ugly bug,\Nbut it was just your shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon, commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have something you want\Nto say to me, then speak clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said if you're gonna step\Non me, then do it harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I can feel you hesitating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me some muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got no reason to hold back on me,\Nso put your foot where your mouth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.55,0:05:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what happened to my book?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, are you so poor that you can't\Nafford even a single textbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Ms. Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too stupid to see\Nwhat you were trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about time\Nyou learned your lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you absolute - I can't believe\Nyou wanted to sit next to me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in class so badly that you hid\Nmy textbook to make it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we're already safe neighbors,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:06:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't mind scooting\Ncloser so that we can share.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.16,0:06:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making zero sense right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Ray, I have no idea\Nwhat goes through your mind.
