Dialogue: 2,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.81,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnBellova\fs108\fad(100,0)\pos(960,843)\fsp6\c&H000000&\blur0.8}Misha Jur
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just had to start the\Nyear provoking people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't say I'm surprised Miss\NClaire's coming after you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say she's coming after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's honestly more like\Nthe other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, as your roommate, I\Nfeel I owe you this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not get on Miss Claire's\Nbad side this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her family,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the House of Francois, is one of the most\Nprestigious families in the Bauer Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you upset her, there's\Nnothing she can't do to get even.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You worry way too much, Misha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm from a ruined noble family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know how these things work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, I love everything\Nabout Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love that she's a\Nself-serving princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could anyone not fall for that wicked
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:06:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gaggle she does when\Nshe's being malicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's my perfect evil queen\Nand I would die for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You truly are one twisted individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing about Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though she's a bully,\Nshe only takes it so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She pushed me down in the\Nhallway where it was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she only hid my textbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please have faith in us, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We would be more than happy to\Ntake care of that commoner for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I want her to submit to me, I'm more\Nthan capable of making her do it on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though everyone wants\Nto do favors for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire would rather\Nbully others herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a proud person by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She uses intimidation to\Nhide how fragile she can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never dislike her when\NI understand who she really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's that complexity that\Nmakes her so irresistible to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, how unsurprising —\Nno one wanted to be your
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,partner that seems to happen to you lowly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,commoners a lot teacher it's okay miss\Nclaire said she'll be my partner no i did not
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're so filthy i thought\Nyou were a pile of mud
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has no touching!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so cold, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please warm me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire, why is\Nthis flower in my spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it's my very first gift from you,\NI'll press it so I can keep it always.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is a weed, you utter moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that maybe\Nyou're being a bit too resilient?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean exactly that! That face!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why on earth are you smiling\Nthroughout my mistreatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistreatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean tough love?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:08:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what would you\Ncall all this flirting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak to\Nme in anger, Ray Taylor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoners must keep quiet and\Ndevote themselves to hard labor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I am devoting myself to\Nthe hardest labor of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The labor of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take any more of\Nthis girl! Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you lose heart now, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What doesn't kill you makes\Nyou stronger, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're being so resistant\Nto her bullying that Miss
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire is about to quit\Nbothering you altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop what I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do if she\Nstops being mean to me, Misha?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you could try becoming\Nsomeone she can't resist harassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's the kind of person who always has
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be the best and in\Ncontrol of everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:09:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I behave the way my\Navatar would in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then Miss Claire will get competitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then she'll have no\Nchoice but to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll get to be close\Nto her and she'll attack
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me again and again and\Nround and round it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Less than a week into the term, and I've\Ngotten to spend so much time with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.82,0:10:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This feels like a win-win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you greet her with familiarity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire belongs to a\Ncompletely different world than...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I'm sorry, but I'm not\Ninterested in talking to our minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to say good\Nday to you, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You embarrass yourself, commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange that you'd think I'd\Nhave anything to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially when you don't\Nunderstand that good
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,day is said when you\Npart ways with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you still talk to me\Nand you cared enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,correct my mistake so that\NI can be a better person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been mocking me for days now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These ridiculous jokes aren't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've become quite the\Neyesore on this campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too early to be making so much noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot the object of the\Ngame is to date the three princes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be less interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the first prince, Rod Bauer.
