Dialogue: 2,0:11:33.38,0:11:35.55,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnBellova\fs108\fad(100,0)\pos(960,843)\fsp6\c&H000000&\blur0.8}Third Prince      Yu Bauer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Three Princes of Bower Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is where we are now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're here because they're the\Nactual romance routes in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You having fun without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems pretty rude of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Prince Rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We weren't having any fun\Nwhatsoever, I promise you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just shooing away\Na filthy little pest
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who was trying to bring\Ndisorder to this academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my hearing's not great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say you wanted to\Nget disorderly with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I most certainly did not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray Taylor, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to finally meet the\Nhighest-ranking new student.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yes, Prince Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went to the same elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's certainly different from the\Nnoble girls we usually see around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His new merit-based admissions policy is\Nturning out some pretty hilarious results.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thane!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care to say hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.42,0:12:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Prince Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go over\Nthere and talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you suggest something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think you know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one Miss Claire actually has\Nfeelings for is Prince Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an absolutely preposterous idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your impudent mouth at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops. It slipped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.82,0:12:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at how cute she is when\Nshe's all mad and blustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:12:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are so wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:13:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no interest whatsoever\Nin Prince Thane's favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, um, please forgive\Nme, I didn't mean to -
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.74,0:13:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear that, Thane?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.57,0:13:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got rejected by a girl\Nwithout even pursuing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I'm striking out\Nleft and right today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so dark and gloomy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I imagine it's hard not to be when\Nyou're always in your brother's shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He obviously is super insecure\Nabout it, and because of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's not the easiest person to talk to.
