Dialogue: 3,0:13:27.83,0:13:31.33,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fs45\fnTBUDRGoStd-Bold\fscy110\bord0.3\fsp0.5\shad0.01\alpha&HFF&\4a&H00&\ko0\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1796.26,879.72)}Me Me Me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a problem with him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've upset Prince Thane!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's go and apologize to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a very sensitive guy, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would a commoner like you know\Nwhat a prince like him is feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why should I apologize with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is none of your concern!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not stand for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:13:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you insist on behaving like\Nthis you leave me no choice
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but to bully you mercilessly\Nuntil you cry and beg me to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself Ray Taylor I will\Nabsolutely never leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water wasn't enough to\Ndeter her. Then I'll dump
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.12,0:14:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tea on her instead no\Nboiling liquid might be too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire, maybe you should just put\Nthat commoner out of your mind for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She honestly seems to enjoy being bullied,\Nwhich is unsettling to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give up when I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.86,0:14:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, are you studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, because our exams are tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, don't remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, who gives exams\Na week into the school year?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'll do. Ray Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see which of us performs\Nbetter on tomorrow's exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:15:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my scores are higher then you're to\Nremove yourself from this academy at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh no thanks I don't\Nwant to well you could at
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,least think it over\Nbefore making a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why there's nothing I stand to gain so
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why would I want to\Ncompete besides if I left
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.52,0:15:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Academy that would\Nmean I wouldn't be able
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to mess around with you\Nanymore stop I do not
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,care for your phrasing\Nthe idea of you messing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around with me could\Nbe Taken the wrong way
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is no reason to\Nback down unless the top
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ranked new Student isn't\Nprepared you have a good
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,point let's do this Miss Claire but if You
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.18,0:15:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't win that means I\Ndo and you'll have to do
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one thing I ask of you\NReally and what makes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you think I would agree\Nis there a reason you're
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Backing away, the\NAcademy's top student isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prepared are you trying\Nto provoke me Ray Taylor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very Well then I accept\Nyour terms Misha you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready you will be our\Nwitness for this competition
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:16:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all right with\Nyou Ray of course it is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.18,0:16:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then make your vows I\Nswear in the name of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Culture, history, literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Subjects unrelated to everyday life\Nare where we nobles reign supreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, I have an\Noverwhelming advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little plebeian is doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.42,0:16:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may now begin your exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all the hours I spent\Ngrinding in this game,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already completed this\Nexam event several times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exams are easy, especially\Nfor fans of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They become a go-to way\Nto score extra points.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.03,0:16:56.74,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,828.5)\fnHiroshige\alpha&HFF&\4a&H00&\shad0.01\ko0\fs75\fsp0\bord4\4c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,391)\fscx95}Second Exam:  Etiquette
Dialogue: 2,0:16:54.03,0:16:56.74,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,828.5)\fnHiroshige\fs75\blur0.6\fad(400,391)\c&H000000&\fscx95}Second Exam:  Etiquette
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, the table manners\Npart was easier than the gameplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was answer\Nmultiple-choice questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure having the\Nskills naturally because
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've been doing it all\Nyour life helps a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nobles definitely\Nhave the advantage here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's too beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't handle that dress!\NIt's too hot! I love her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to burn this image into my retinas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Point deduction for Ray Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First off, we shall assess your ability.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.36,0:17:30.53,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,824.5)\fnHiroshige\1a&HFF&\t(144,145,\1a&H00&)\fs75\fsp0\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.6\3a&HC0&\t(20,145,\3a&H00&)\fscx95\t(3022,3023,\1a&HFF&)\t(2981,3148,\3a&HC9&)}Final Exam: Magic Aptitude
Dialogue: 2,0:17:27.36,0:17:30.53,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,824.5)\fnHiroshige\fs75\blur0.6\1a&HC0&\t(20,145,\1a&H00&)\c&H000000&\fscx95\t(2981,3148,\1a&HC9&)}Final Exam: Magic Aptitude
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second, we will examine\Nyour use of magic tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the basic magic exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will be evaluating your\Nattributes as well as your aptitude
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are four attributes: earth,\Nwater, fire, and wind. In general,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a person can possess only a\Nsingle attribute aptitude has
