Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,five levels exceptional high\Nintermediate low and non-existent
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.62,0:18:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're amazing miss claire high\Naptitude the fire scale that's great
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes it is isn't it my what\Na lively bunch they are
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh what did you just do dear i put my\Nhand over it those of you who have been
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,graded may now move
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on to magic tools
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look like you're having\Na good time Rod hey
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there you what's up done with your exams
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yep all set and how is Thane doing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a bad mood today apparently he had a\Nhard time with the general curriculum exam
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, Ray Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the girl we met with Misha earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was really well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her aim may have been a little off the\Nmark, but she seems to have great intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She moved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said her name's Ray Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, rather unusual for you to\Ncommit anyone's name to memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be so tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm interested in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner, what could you\Npossibly want at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a full day of exams, I'm completely\Nworn out, both mentally and physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.98,0:19:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm replenishing my energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're glowing today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.98,0:20:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene, you did something\Nespecially good happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just excited for the results of\Nour recent exams to be announced.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh goodness, commoner, you have\Nbags under your eyes. Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so funny, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hardly got any sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it because you knew you\Nwere going to lose today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.58,0:20:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I probably wouldn't sleep\Neither if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was actually trying to figure out\Nwhat I'd ask you to do when I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And before I knew it,\Nit was time to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.05,0:20:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have quite some nerve,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,students.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will now announce your results.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, the general curriculum exam.
