Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.80,0:20:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised you and I\Ntook the top two positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not a bad showing, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:20:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.58,0:20:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be some mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I possibly score\Nlower than in a simple commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.04,0:21:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire, what can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't just spend my\Nfree time playing the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also wrote an entire fanfic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a story about Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.28,0:21:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire falling from grace and then\Nrising back up to peak validity.
