Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.68,0:21:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I needed to understand the game's world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the age in which it takes place,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I read every book I\Ncould find on the setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from cover to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I'm pretty sure I know more about\Nthe game than the people who made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.86,0:21:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving on, next we have the\Nresults of the etiquette exam.
