Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that last one was just dumb luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mask has fallen and we can\Nsee your true lack of intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look how excited she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And finally, the results\Nof the magic ability exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you packed your bags, commoner.
