Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.66,0:23:13.05,ed_eng_01_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how much I say it, it'll never, ever be enough!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.05,0:23:14.08,ed_eng_01_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I love you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.08,0:23:17.12,ed_eng_01_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Choice or no choice, I'd still tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.12,0:23:19.73,ed_eng_01_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Joy, gratitude, appreciation, happiness...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.73,0:23:20.99,ed_eng_01_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I wanna express everything!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.99,0:23:23.64,ed_eng_01_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Even if it's just for a minute or just for a second,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.64,0:23:24.55,ed_eng_01_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I wanna be by your side!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.73,0:23:30.58,ed_eng_01_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}Oh! She is my wonder girl of world!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.58,0:23:34.62,ed_eng_01_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}You never existed like this in the world I'm from,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.21,0:23:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know if I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know if I can't do this.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.30,0:23:43.70,ed_eng_01_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}I want to be right here next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.48,0:23:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know if I can't do this?
